[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 65 Not a baby",
    "start": 1.59,
    "end": 5.912,
    "zh": "第65课 不是婴儿了",
    "zh_hant": "第65課 不是嬰兒了"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape",
    "start": 7.033,
    "end": 8.534,
    "zh": "听录音",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "then answer this question.",
    "start": 8.554,
    "end": 10.695,
    "zh": "然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Does Jill take the key to the front door?",
    "start": 12.936,
    "end": 16.438,
    "zh": "吉尔拿前门的钥匙了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "吉爾拿前門的鑰匙了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What are you going to do this evening, Jill?",
    "start": 18.859,
    "end": 22.0,
    "zh": "吉尔，你今晚打算做什么？",
    "zh_hant": "吉爾，你今晚打算做什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "I'm going to meet some friends, Dad.",
    "start": 23.021,
    "end": 25.642,
    "zh": "爸爸，我打算去见几个朋友。",
    "zh_hant": "爸爸，我打算去見幾個朋友。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "You mustn't come home late.",
    "start": 26.343,
    "end": 28.524,
    "zh": "你不许回家太晚。",
    "zh_hant": "你不許回家太晚。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "You must be home at half past ten.",
    "start": 28.804,
    "end": 31.946,
    "zh": "你必须十点半到家。",
    "zh_hant": "你必須十點半到家。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "I can't get home so early, Dad!",
    "start": 33.226,
    "end": 36.268,
    "zh": "爸爸，我回不了那么早！",
    "zh_hant": "爸爸，我回不了那麼早！"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Can I have the key to the front door, please?",
    "start": 37.549,
    "end": 40.77,
    "zh": "我能拿前门的钥匙吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我能拿前門的鑰匙嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "No, you can't.",
    "start": 41.131,
    "end": 43.231,
    "zh": "不，你不能。",
    "zh_hant": "不，你不能。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "Jill's eighteen years old, Tom.",
    "start": 44.552,
    "end": 47.494,
    "zh": "汤姆，吉尔已经十八岁了。",
    "zh_hant": "湯姆，吉爾已經十八歲了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "She's not a baby.",
    "start": 47.714,
    "end": 49.174,
    "zh": "她不是婴儿了。",
    "zh_hant": "她不是嬰兒了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Give her the key.",
    "start": 49.535,
    "end": 50.975,
    "zh": "把钥匙给她。",
    "zh_hant": "把鑰匙給她。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "She always comes home early.",
    "start": 51.536,
    "end": 54.017,
    "zh": "她总是很早回家。",
    "zh_hant": "她總是很早回家。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Oh, all right!",
    "start": 54.798,
    "end": 56.978,
    "zh": "哦，好吧！",
    "zh_hant": "哦，好吧！"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Here you are.",
    "start": 57.979,
    "end": 59.3,
    "zh": "给你。",
    "zh_hant": "給你。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "But you mustn't come home after a quarter past eleven.",
    "start": 59.64,
    "end": 63.782,
    "zh": "但你十一点一刻之后不许回家。",
    "zh_hant": "但你十一點一刻之後不許回家。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Do you hear?",
    "start": 63.862,
    "end": 64.943,
    "zh": "听见了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "聽見了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Yes, Dad.",
    "start": 65.643,
    "end": 67.404,
    "zh": "听见了，爸爸。",
    "zh_hant": "聽見了，爸爸。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Thanks, Mum.",
    "start": 68.084,
    "end": 69.245,
    "zh": "谢谢，妈妈。",
    "zh_hant": "謝謝，媽媽。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "That's all right.",
    "start": 70.386,
    "end": 71.706,
    "zh": "没关系。",
    "zh_hant": "沒關係。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Goodbye.",
    "start": 72.127,
    "end": 73.187,
    "zh": "再见。",
    "zh_hant": "再見。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "Enjoy yourself!",
    "start": 73.507,
    "end": 75.028,
    "zh": "玩得开心！",
    "zh_hant": "玩得開心！"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "We always enjoy ourselves, Mum.",
    "start": 75.908,
    "end": 78.55,
    "zh": "妈妈，我们总是玩得很开心。",
    "zh_hant": "媽媽，我們總是玩得很開心。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Bye-bye.",
    "start": 78.59,
    "end": 79.39,
    "zh": "再见。",
    "zh_hant": "再見。"
  }
]
